# Render Static Site rewrites
#
# Proxy API calls to the backend so they appear same-origin to the browser.
# This makes auth cookies FIRST-PARTY — works in Chrome Incognito, Safari,
# Edge, and any browser regardless of third-party cookie settings.
/api/*  https://urbandotted-api.onrender.com/api/:splat  200

# Single-page app fallback: any non-file, non-/api path serves index.html.
/*      /index.html                                     200
